quran[4]{c,v,t}:
  5,10,And those who disbelieve and deny Our revelations shall be the inhabitants of the Hellfire.
  5,11,"O believers! Remember Allah’s blessing upon you when (some) people sought to extend their hands against you, but He restrained their hands from you. Be conscious of Allah. And in Allah, let the believers put their trust."
  5,12,"Allah made a covenant with the Children of Israel, and We raised twelve leaders among them. And Allah said: ‘I am surely with you.’ If you establish the prayer, pay the alms due, believe in My messengers, support them and lend Allah a generous loan, I will most certainly absolve you of your misdeeds and will surely admit you into Gardens with rivers flowing beneath them. But whoever among you disbelieves after that has certainly strayed from the right path."
  5,13,"Then, for their breaking their covenant, We cursed them and hardened their hearts. They distort the words (of Allah’s Book) from their places (or their meanings), and they have forgotten a part of what they were reminded of. And you will not cease to discover treachery on their part, except a few of them. So pardon them and forbear. Indeed, Allah loves the benevolent."
